    { v = "0.25.0", d = "2026-10-09", from = "0.24.0", text = [[
### Added

- **Changelog page.** `{cmd} changelog` (or Main menu → Changelog) shows what changed in every version, newest
  first. "Copy text" turns a version's notes into plain text you can copy into a post or a message.
