### Changed

- **The update notice now hears about new versions from every {name} player on your realm**, not only your guild
  and group. It uses a hidden channel that never shows in your chat windows, and the notes are signed, so nobody
  can fake an update notice. The window opens as soon as a newer version is known and at every login after that
  until you update (never in combat). `{cmd} version status` shows what the check sees; turning the setting off
  leaves the channel.

Needs a game restart (new files).]] },
    { v = "0.24.0", d = "2026-10-09", from = "0.23.5", text = [[
### Added

- **Update notice.** {name} now tells you when a newer version exists. Your copy and the copies of your guild and
  group swap version numbers quietly (addon messages, never chat). When someone runs a newer one, a window opens at
  your next login (out of combat) with step-by-step update instructions for the CurseForge app and for a manual
